    "## Gibbs free-energy barrier from RRHO thermochemistry\n",
    "\n",
    "This adds ideal-gas RRHO thermal/entropy corrections from the optimized geometries and vibrational frequencies. Negative/imaginary frequencies are excluded from the thermochemistry. Low positive frequencies are treated with a small cutoff to avoid unphysical entropy spikes from floppy cluster modes.\n"
   ]
